#0 0x5643dfad81ed in operator new(unsigned long) /src/llvm-project/compiler-rt/lib/asan/asan_new_delete.cpp:86:3
#1 0x5643dfc50ba4 in std::__1::basic_string<char, std::__1::char_traits<char>, std::__1::allocator<char>>::reserve(unsigned long) (out/libfuzzer-address-x86_64/fuzz_parsers+0x3c3ba4)

DEDUP_TOKEN: operator new(unsigned long)--std::__1::basic_string<char, std::__1::char_traits<char>, std::__1::allocator<char>>::reserve(unsigned long)
==18==HINT: if you don't care about these errors you may set allocator_may_return_null=1

